{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261024/photo/bkn-20261024174629368-1024_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261024184053\"/><p>彌敦道一找換店發現懷疑偽鈔。</p><p>今午(24日)2時06分，油麻地彌敦道514號一間找換店的職員報案，指有人以5張面值100美元的懷疑偽鈔兌換貨幣。警員接報到場，經初步調查後，以涉嫌「行使偽製紙幣」拘捕一名持香港身份證的43歲尼泊爾裔婦人，她現正被扣留調查。據悉，涉案偽鈔的號碼全部相同。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:22:51.643628+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T09:46:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T11:37:39.443363+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T11:18:10.172944+00:00","content_hash":"729dd0ce904f7c09a80f2e1f6169e3d39d4ad16d0d823c18eaceeb5c088ac9a1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:22:51.643628+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}